ate-year-hint\">Enter 4 digits for the year.</span>\n      <input class=\"usa-input\" aria-describedby=\"memorable-date-year-hint\" id=\"memorable-date-year\" name=\"memorable-date-year\" minlength=\"4\" maxlength=\"4\" pattern=\"[0-9]*\" inputmode=\"numeric\" value=\"\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</fieldset>"
